<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>钓鱼 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%92%93%E9%B1%BC/</link><description>Recent content in 钓鱼 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E9%92%93%E9%B1%BC/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>钓鱼与户外</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/fishing-and-outdoors/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/sports/fishing-and-outdoors/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;在美国钓鱼&lt;strong&gt;必须买钓鱼证&lt;/strong&gt;（&lt;code&gt;fishing license&lt;/code&gt;），这是州法，不是可选项。渔警（&lt;code&gt;game warden&lt;/code&gt;）会真的来查，没证罚款起步一百多美元，还要上法庭。证在沃尔玛、体育用品店（&lt;code&gt; sporting goods store&lt;/code&gt;）或者州渔猎局网站都能买，居民和非居民价格差很多。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>